# Preserve the recovered 1990s DOS files byte-for-byte: no line-ending or
# text conversion. This repo is a faithful archive of the decrypted project.
* -text

# The recovered sources are CP437, which makes a UTF-8 locale call them binary.
# `diff=cp437` only changes how git *shows* them (see the textconv in
# CONTRIBUTING/HANDOVER); the stored bytes stay exactly as they were in 1995.
legacy/**/*.mod diff=cp437
legacy/**/*.def diff=cp437
legacy/**/*.awk diff=cp437
legacy/**/*.txt diff=cp437
legacy/**/*.bat diff=cp437
legacy/**/*.pas diff=cp437
legacy/**/*.pre diff=cp437
